sequenceDiagram
  participant Client as socketService
  participant Server as utils/socket.js
  participant Redis
  participant Chat as MongoDB Chat
  Client->>Server: connect / register_user(userId)
  Server->>Redis: update user_presence
  Client->>Server: join_chat / typing_start
  Client->>Server: send_message payload
  Server->>Server: check connection or job relation
  Server->>Chat: persist message
  Chat-->>Server: saved document
  Server-->>Client: message_sent / receive_message
  Server->>Redis: cross-node room broadcast adapter
  Client->>Server: message_delivered or mark_messages_read
  Server->>Chat: update status
  Server-->>Client: status event
  Note over Client,Server: Current registration appears client-claimed; authenticate socket handshake before trusting identity
